    <p class="text-xl mt-4">You have successfully created a new Wisp MVC project!</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-4">Getting Started</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside ps-4 mt-2 gap-y-2 flex flex-col">
